  "description": "Conjoined twins at birth, they have two heads, one body, but can they balance their double lives in the circus and challenge an unforgiving world? Or will Garnet and Jade lose their heads trying? Ladies and gents, boys and girls, and intrepid seekers of the most curious curios round the globe, gather round the circus and see the jewels of the orient, the wondrous, the most unbreakable, the Ring Brothers Garnet and Jade! Come one, come all and witness their greatest and final act: The Curious Case of the Ring Brothers!\nSource: Tapas",
